<title>UK: SmithKline details scrip dividend plan.</title>
<headline>SmithKline details scrip dividend plan.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>SmithKline Beecham Plc said shareholders opting to have their second interim dividend paid in shares and cash, instead of cash only, will receive one new share and 0.0043 pence per share for every 399 share held.</p>
<p>Shareholders who want to opt for the script dividend offer should apply at the Royal Bank of Scotland before September 3.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
